# Benchmark output, not benchmark code. The screenshots are megabytes of one
# particular graphics card's opinion, and latest.json is a set of timings from
# one integrated Radeon with a forty per cent run-to-run spread. Committing them
# invites the exact mistake the tool exists to prevent — comparing numbers that
# were never comparable. tools/test/bench.mjs is the part worth keeping.
tests/bench/
